      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like this patch changes:\n\n\nother_file\u003dNR_FILE_PAGES-NR_SHMEM-total_swapcache_pages-NR_UNEVICTABLE\n\n\ninto:\n\n\nother_file\u003dNR_FILE_PAGES-NR_SHMEM-total_swapcache_pages-NR_UNEVICTABLE+\nmax(0,NR_ANON_PAGES+NR_SHMEM+total_swapcache_pages/2-NR_INACTIVE_ANON-NR_ACTIVE_ANON)\n\n\nNote that the first part of the calculation is unchanged. So effectively it can be simplified into adding this line:\n\n\nother_file +\u003d max(0,NR_ANON_PAGES+NR_SHMEM+total_swapcache_pages/2-NR_INACTIVE_ANON-NR_ACTIVE_ANON)\n\n\nafter unmodified original other_file calculation, hence minimizing changes to the original code.\n\nBesides I think a comment would be useful to explain this calculation, for example why total_swapcache_pages/2 is added back after total_swapcache_pages was subtracted.",
